---
name: convo-review
description: Review a finished Claude Code session with agent-lens (summary plus prompt feedback). Not available yet: arrives in agent-lens milestone 3.
disable-model-invocation: true
---

This is a placeholder for agent-lens milestone 3 (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md in the agent-lens repository).

When implemented it will be a thin wrapper: it runs `agent-lens review <session-id>` out of process and shows the
resulting summary. The session digest is never loaded into this conversation.

Until then, tell the user that session review is not implemented yet and that `agent-lens report --session <id>`
shows usage and cost for any recorded session.
